      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nFollowing https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48952, add ModelOpt FP8 support for Cosmos3-Edge's (`Cosmos3EdgeConditionalGeneration`) unified checkpoint format.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n1. Add `test_cosmos3_edge_modelopt_quantizer_weights_mapper()` in `tests/models/multimodal/test_mapping.py`. Run with\r\n\r\n    ```sh\r\n    pytest tests/models/multimodal/test_mapping.py -k test_cosmos3_edge_modelopt_quantizer_weights_mapper\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n2. Ran `vllm serve` on quantized Cosmos3-Edge model.\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n1. Test passes after the mapper is updated.\r\n2. `vllm serve` correctly loads the model without complaining the extra tensors.\r\n\r\n---\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist </summary>\r\n\r\n- [x] The purpose of the PR, such as \"Fix some issue (link existing issues this PR will resolve)\".\r\n- [x] The test plan, such as providing test command.\r\n- [x] The test results, such as pasting the results comparison before and after, or e2e results\r\n- [ ] (Optional) The necessary documentation update, such as updating `supported_models.md` and `examples` for a new model.\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n",
